  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to the plane of absolute order lets you equalize chaotic moments. When a creature you can see within 60 feet of you is about to roll a d20 with Advantage or Disadvantage, you can take a Reaction to prevent the roll from being affected by Advantage and Disadvantage. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
